(7631507, 1237090, 83313, '<td valign="top">A lot of soft elements in this pic  tells me you aren''t using a higher end phone. Hard to ding you for that aspect in a challenge like this. A few years ago this is what every phone cam photo looked like. But the composition is good, the terrain interesting and some nice poofy clouds.</td>', 'A lot of soft elements in this pic  tells me you aren''t using a higher end phone. Hard to ding you for that aspect in a challenge like this. A few years ago this is what every phone cam photo looked like. But the composition is good, the terrain interesting and some nice poofy clouds.', '2019-06-01 00:11:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7631572, 1237151, 65234, '<td valign="top">Perfect timing on the capture!</td>', 'Perfect timing on the capture!', '2019-06-01 12:32:27.000000', NULL, 1),
