(7631580, 1237146, 65234, '<td valign="top">Very nice flower image. I find DOF to be the thing I have the least control over with my phone and it drives me nuts. Kudos on the DOF on this one.</td>', 'Very nice flower image. I find DOF to be the thing I have the least control over with my phone and it drives me nuts. Kudos on the DOF on this one.', '2019-06-01 12:44:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7631607, 1237173, 12611, '<td valign="top">I saw this and the yellow one on FB. Amazingly close. My wife grew up in Warwick Rhode island, which is essentially a "city" surrounding and airport. Planes would fly so close to her house you could ask for peanuts from her front porch. Hope your trip was as great as the pics!</td>', 'I saw this and the yellow one on FB. Amazingly close. My wife grew up in Warwick Rhode island, which is essentially a "city" surrounding and airport. Planes would fly so close to her house you could ask for peanuts from her front porch. Hope your trip was as great as the pics!', '2019-06-01 22:55:02.000000', NULL, 1),
