(7632028, 1237245, 67258, '<td valign="top">St Ives without people!  During the day and at the height of summer these roads are quite frightening - you have no choice but to be swept up in the crush of visitors, and trying to go against the flow can be quite impossible.  I love St Ives - and this photo shows why, but not with the volume of holiday makers thta are attracted over the school holidays.</td>', 'St Ives without people!  During the day and at the height of summer these roads are quite frightening - you have no choice but to be swept up in the crush of visitors, and trying to go against the flow can be quite impossible.  I love St Ives - and this photo shows why, but not with the volume of holiday makers thta are attracted over the school holidays.', '2019-06-05 10:38:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7632029, 1237230, 67258, '<td valign="top">Delightful!</td>', 'Delightful!', '2019-06-05 10:39:41.000000', NULL, 1),
