(7632161, 1237151, 30861, '<td valign="top">Well done, Anita! I was one of the 10''s. These phones are incredible... As for "Easter Eggs", those are when a creator hides an element somewhere for you (the viewer) to discover: like that tiny person at the far left.</td>', 'Well done, Anita! I was one of the 10''s. These phones are incredible... As for "Easter Eggs", those are when a creator hides an element somewhere for you (the viewer) to discover: like that tiny person at the far left.', '2019-06-07 01:12:27.000000', NULL, 0),
