(7632170, 1237151, 114285, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by marnet:</b></div><hr/><i> I have seen this lake only with the snow or ice. Whistler is still my favorite skiing place in spite of having now skied in many places around Switzerland, France and Austria. Unfortunately we can''t go skiing to Canada any more due to the lack of skiing accident insurance :( <br/> <br/>Why is the sky so dark? Is it automatic conversion in this phone? Congrats on the red. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/> I darkened  the sky because I felt it made more impact. Took this shot at 10:58 am in the bright sun, you know what its like taking photos during this time of the day, theyre not always the best. <br/> <br/>Thanks anyway.</td>', 'Originally posted by marnet: I have seen this lake only with the snow or ice. Whistler is still my favorite skiing place in spite of having now skied in many places around Switzerland, France and Austria. Unfortunately we can''t go skiing to Canada any more due to the lack of skiing accident insurance :(  Why is the sky so dark? Is it automatic conversion in this phone? Congrats on the red.    I darkened  the sky because I felt it made more impact. Took this shot at 10:58 am in the bright sun, you know what its like taking photos during this time of the day, theyre not always the best.  Thanks anyway.', '2019-06-07 01:49:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(7632171, 1237151, 83313, '<td valign="top">Yay! Afraid I didn''t vote on this entry, since I knew it was yours. I might have to consider the Pixel for my next phone when my Moto G4 dies.</td>', 'Yay! Afraid I didn''t vote on this entry, since I knew it was yours. I might have to consider the Pixel for my next phone when my Moto G4 dies.', '2019-06-07 02:00:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(7632176, 1237201, 173844, '<td valign="top">We''re dropped into intimacy in the animals'' world, the Canada geese, and allowed to wander freely, a fine privilege.  The human world, and of course this is an arbitrary dichotomy, is tucked up by the edge and with modest bearing on what spreads out below.  The black and white, the generous shadows, the harsh precision all contribute to a mood, as I see it, of heightened reality.  This image is forged of silver and carbon.  Beautiful.  It''s my personal favorite of the challenge, the eight, and I''m embarrassed by my spendthrift disbursal of points.</td>', 'We''re dropped into intimacy in the animals'' world, the Canada geese, and allowed to wander freely, a fine privilege.  The human world, and of course this is an arbitrary dichotomy, is tucked up by the edge and with modest bearing on what spreads out below.  The black and white, the generous shadows, the harsh precision all contribute to a mood, as I see it, of heightened reality.  This image is forged of silver and carbon.  Beautiful.  It''s my personal favorite of the challenge, the eight, and I''m embarrassed by my spendthrift disbursal of points.', '2019-06-07 09:15:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(7632177, 1237239, 173844, '<td valign="top">Last place. A gem.  A seven from me, and I did tend to be in a surly mood as I rated this challenge.  Just was.  The colors, the processing of lovely dappling and imprecision, the composition.  I am, right now, literally throwing up my arms in consternation.</td>', 'Last place. A gem.  A seven from me, and I did tend to be in a surly mood as I rated this challenge.  Just was.  The colors, the processing of lovely dappling and imprecision, the composition.  I am, right now, literally throwing up my arms in consternation.', '2019-06-07 09:31:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(7632178, 1237207, 173844, '<td valign="top">A modern echo of Edward Hopper.  The shadows, the distance, the attention to seemingly incidental details, the sense of isolation, all these are here in expressive sepia.  The graininess and vignette work well. Lovely.  Seven, sorry.  But it''s going into favorites, and happily so.</td>', 'A modern echo of Edward Hopper.  The shadows, the distance, the attention to seemingly incidental details, the sense of isolation, all these are here in expressive sepia.  The graininess and vignette work well. Lovely.  Seven, sorry.  But it''s going into favorites, and happily so.', '2019-06-07 09:42:37.000000', NULL, 0),
